    {
      "data": {
        "text": "**Choosing Image Text Detection**\n\nI've decided to create a Python script, `detect_image_text.py`, to detect text within images. To implement this, I'm focusing on a specific external provider: Google Cloud Vision AI. This is a good starting point for a concrete implementation.\n\n\n**Initiating File Creation**\n\nI'm now generating the `detect_image_text.py` file. I'm taking the steps to ensure I'm in the proper directory before beginning. I'll include the necessary imports and client initialization specific to Google Cloud Vision AI, which will be the concrete provider used for this text detection function. I'll be using the `google.cloud.vision_v1` library.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789864559246,
          "start": 1789864557004
        },
        "type": "reasoning"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bc3db9cc0014IDyJJm3nGQ0hJ",
      "message_id": "msg_0bc3db57d001p1Y3J3CH0U9wib",
      "session_id": "ses_f43c24a93ffex1Df6nrw0KDkmT",
      "time_created": 1789864557004,
      "time_updated": 1789864559247
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "callID": "B0wOBQt4rqMxt9tS",
        "metadata": {
          "google": {
            "thoughtSignature": ""
          }
        },
        "state": {
          "input": {
            "content": "from google.cloud import vision\n\ndef detect_text(image_path):\n    \"\"\"Detects text in the image using the Google Cloud Vision API.\"\"\"\n    client = vision.ImageAnnotatorClient()\n\n    with open(image_path, 'rb') as image_file:\n        content = image_file.read()\n\n    image = vision.Image(content=content)\n\n    response = client.text_detection(image=image)\n    texts = response.text_annotations\n\n    detected_texts = []\n    if texts:\n        # The first text annotation is the overall text detected in the image\n        # Subsequent annotations are individual words or lines\n        full_text = texts[0].description\n        detected_texts.append({\"full_text\": full_text})\n\n        for text in texts[1:]:\n            detected_texts.append({\n                \"description\": text.description,\n                \"bounding_poly\": [{\"x\": v.x, \"y\": v.y} for v in text.bounding_poly.vertices]\n            })\n\n    if response.error.message:\n        raise Exception(\n            f'{response.error.message}\nFor more info on error messages, check: '\n            f'https://cloud.google.com/apis/design/errors'\n        )\n\n    return detected_texts\n\n",
            "filePath": "detect_image_text.py"
          },
