      "data": {
        "text": "**Defining the Script's Purpose**\n\nI'm solidifying the initial requirements. I'm focusing on creating a Python script, specifically `detect_image_labels.py`, designed to identify labels and objects within a static image. I've narrowed down the external service; Google Cloud Vision AI is the chosen provider and must be explicitly integrated.\n\n\n**Outlining the Implementation**\n\nI'm now detailing the implementation steps for `detect_image_labels.py`. The file creation is done, and I'm tackling the Google Cloud Vision AI integration. I'll need to import the client and define an image path input function. I'll then use the `ImageAnnotatorClient` to return detected image labels.\n\n\n",
